Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理·布拉德布利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Bradbury?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.89,0:00:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我删掉硬盘上的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I erase the drive first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后继续过我的小日子  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I go back to my old life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有小日子可继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have an old life anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不要再找我了  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never contact me again, like, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要留下来  我会和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stay, I would be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你要离开  别再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you leave... don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你的决定是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you decide...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不会忘记你为我做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've done for me I will never forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我就是在跟兰斯说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. I'm talking to Lance, not --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都为了接近她耍手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we both cut corners to get close to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不算作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that wasn't cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:01:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  这只是游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(伯德  夏德  兰斯  你会付出代价)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.43,0:01:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:02:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ok, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有对付恶魔最厉害的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the most powerful weapon we've ever had against demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们却不会使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can't find a way to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文在想办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, Kevin's on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又发现他会打电话来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he finds something, he'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等着就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这几周都过得不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we have both had a rough go over these past couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的牺牲很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you gave up wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.23,0:02:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们该放松一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we ought to take the night off --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看部电影  找一两个酒吧喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go see a flick, hit a bar or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得那滋味吧  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember fun, don't you, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:03:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找张纸记下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you grab a piece of paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Okay. Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢啦  伙计  -客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, man. - Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  盖思  还在吗  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, wait, hey, Garth. Garth, are you there? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-how'd you know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被盖思秒杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've been Garthed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你追踪我们就够糟的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's bad enough that you're tracking us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's even worse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被盖思秒杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you say we've been "Garthed."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.35,0:03:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们得关掉手机GPS\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got to lose the gps on our phones
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为盖思一直在追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}because garth has been tracking us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然其他猎人也是  方便他分配任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other hunters, apparently, to assign cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺效率啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比也会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A total Bobby move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺近的  密歇根  法明顿山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, it's close -- Farmington Hills, Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在上锁的公寓里惨遭车裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude got ripped limb from limb inside his locked apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:45.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着凯文消息的期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we're waiting on Kevin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把这当乐子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll be our fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是塔戈特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent Taggart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我搭档罗斯伍德特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, special agent Rosewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局  你们挺迅速啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI? You guys are quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体都没搬走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't even got the body out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局都是工作狂  不休息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the FBI is all work, no play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  你跟我说下情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, why don't you give me the tour
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搭档到处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}while my partner looks around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己干效率比较高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work better on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说了算  跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world, agent. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者叫艾德·尼尔森  31岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vic's name was Ed Nelson, 31 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保险核保人\N{\fnArial\fs30}an insurance-claim adjuster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,独居  这不奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived alone, which was a real shocker,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿到处是玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering his place is full of toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有强行闯入的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of forced entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前看来  他是被人绑起来  扯碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near as we can tell, he was tied up and pulled apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吓死的就是流血致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died of the shock or massive blood loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这看他自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dealer's choice on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些链条是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about these chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是锁子甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually chain mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他手腕和脚踝上都有清晰的绳印\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did find clear rope-burn marks on his wrists and ankles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他身上有什么不见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing from the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说除了胳膊腿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean aside from the arms and legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在呢  肠子肚子都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}All there -- twig and berries, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邻居有听到什么奇怪的声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the neighbors? Did they hear anything weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,楼下的邻居说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, neighbor downstairs said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她半夜被惊醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}she got woke up in the middle of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为听到马声\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the sound of horses
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是跺蹄子又是飞奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}stomping their feet and galloping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没看到蹄印\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't find any hoofprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她听到的大概是电视  要么就是做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She probably heard a tv or was having a bad dream
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她嗑药磕大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or she was high as balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好  他手机上有条不错的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, we got a real lead off his cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电话记录显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the phone records,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德最后一通电话是跟兰斯·雅各布森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed's last call was from a guy called Lance Jacobsen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个会计  也是三十多  也是独居\N{\fnArial\fs30}an accountant, also 30s, also lives alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:05:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么说是线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he a lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:06:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两人大概谈了15分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of them talked together for 15 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后兰斯给艾德发了些怒气冲冲的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then Lance sent Ed here all kinds of angry texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些是一般的狠话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them were your typical threat stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有些挺怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but some were a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么个怪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我们的罪行要血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You shall bleed for your crimes against us,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面是一个骷髅的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed by the emoticon of a skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this beauty --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个法师  我会灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am a mage. I will destroy you."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这些孩子  都在闹哪样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These kids today with their texting and murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人把兰斯带去局里问话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men just brought Lance into the station for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要先审他一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're gonna need to take first crack at the suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  你们说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, agent, it's your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯·雅各布森  我们是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance Jacobsen? We're with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德居然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe Ed's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:06:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯  呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance, just -- just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe. You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to know about the, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚发给艾德的那些短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}the texts you sent Ed last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们带我来的时候我就说了那些不是我发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them when they brought me in those texts weren't from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你的手机和艾德的手机里都有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your phone and Ed's phone say otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说是我发的  但不是我发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, they were from me, but they weren't from me me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得这么说就清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think that sentence was gonna clear things up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:27.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all a big misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些短信是以法师灰狐狸这个身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those text messages were from Greyfox the Mystic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发给贫士撒格瑞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Thargrim the Difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们在月门里的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our characters in Moondoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月门是我和艾德玩的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moondoor is a game that Ed and I play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们玩真人扮演游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're LARPers. Live-action role-playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  真人扮演  是有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Larping. Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们每隔一个周末在民俗公园玩月门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We play Moondoor every other weekend at Heritage Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切信息都在我们网站上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the info about it is on our website.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还有网站呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have a website.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  一个玩家设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one of the players designed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:58.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  如果你登陆网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, if you log onto the site,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们应该发布了昨晚集会的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}they should have posted pictures from last night's feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整晚都在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些跟你发的短信有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does any of this have to do with the texts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在游戏中的角色是法师灰狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I play a character named Greyfox the Mystic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是游戏里一个法力极强的法师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a very, very powerful mage in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法力极强  继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, very powerful. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.07,0:08:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德是老森林的撒格瑞姆 贫士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed was Thargrim the Difficult of the Elder Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈格里姆和布尔芬的儿子  兄弟是\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of Hargrim and Bouphin, brother to --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是梅林他就是兰斯洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was Lancelot to my Merlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们既然这么铁  怎么发短信威胁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you guys were so tight, then why the threatening messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.99,0:08:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被授予女王荣誉护卫一职\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were named to the queen's honor guard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为这周末的诸国之战做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}in anticipation of the coming battle of kingdoms this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他破坏了规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he broke protocol,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以结束后我打电话给他  说他作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I called Ed after game hours and accused him of cheating,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我提出跟他决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I challenged him to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-决斗  -天明时分剑锋对魔杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A duel? - Wands and swords at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:09:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔杖是指有魔法的手杖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when you say "wands"" do you mean magic wands?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有魔法  特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Un-magic wands, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我就想带着没魔法的去决斗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what I really want in a duel is an un-magic wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是假魔杖  这叫游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Fake wands! It's a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诸神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ye gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒格瑞姆 贫士陨落啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thargrim the Difficult has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯  撑着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-Lance -- Lance. Hang in there, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信游戏的这套话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe dungeons & dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没骗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't put a whammy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是真的很难过  他不是凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those weren't crocodile tears, man. That's not our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到锁子甲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the chain mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定是什么重口的情趣玩具呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be "Fifty shades of Greyfox" for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们看看月门的网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's check out Moondoor site,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,核实一下兰斯的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if Lance's story checks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入月门  密歇根最大的真人扮演游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Welcome to Moondoor, Michigan's largest larping game""
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为我们是最宅的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought we needed to get out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还挺不赖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It actually looks kind of awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there's a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月门  阴谋诡计  荣誉激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moondoor. A world of intrigue, honor, passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四大王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four kingdoms --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.57,0:10:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月随者  精灵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followers of the moon, elves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亡灵战士  和可怕的影兽人\N{\fnArial\fs30}warriors of yesteryear, and the dreaded shadow orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都将在永世之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will fight on the Fields of Never
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,参加两年一次的诸国之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the biannual battle of kingdoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:44.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择你的剑或权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up a sword or a mace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取月门  维护当今统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control of Moondoor and defend the current ruler...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the Queen of Moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会想看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别是传染病\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid he was contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去把自己泡在洗手液里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go dip myself in hand sanitizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有电磁干扰  没有巫术袋  没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No EMF, no hex bags, no sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不明白  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nada. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再看一次录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the video again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟艾德的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as Ed's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们有一样的纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe they had matching tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟他们是好战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they were brothers in arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认得出吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognize it from anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒂姆·波顿的电影里出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Tim Burton movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了这个诡异的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aside from the, uh, mark of the creepy here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们唯一的共同点就是真人扮演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing these guys have in common is larping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我们认识女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us, we know the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我狂怒波尔塔将你押在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, Boltar the Furious, bind you to this stock
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让月门的所有人都能看清你的面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that all of Moondoor may see you for what you are --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:13:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我影兽人的兄弟会从黑山下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Shadow Orc brethren will descend from the Black Hills
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这里的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the tents of mo--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  杰里  真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Gerry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气  蒙蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no problem, Monty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.51,0:13:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而月门的帐篷将浸透鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the tents of Moondoor will be bathed in blood
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.37,0:13:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将那月女王罢黜\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we unseat the Queen of the Moons
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的王位是篡夺而来  名正言顺的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the throne she stole from the rightful heir --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应是暗影之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Shadow King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你  -安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you - - Silentium!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好服刑吧  希顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serve your time with honor, Heathen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你需要用夜壶  跺三次脚即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you need to use the chamber pot, stomp your feet thrice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰  你是玩真人扮演的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Hi. Uh, you are a larper, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢说是"互动文学爱好者"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer the term "Interactive literaturist""
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是罗斯伍德特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Uh, I am special agent Rosewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是塔戈特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is special agent Taggart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  我们这周末不玩穿越\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, guys, we're not doing the whole genre-mash-up thing this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个月才做一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only do that every third month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假徽章  低价西服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fake badges, the cheap suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺不错的  你们是扮演联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very cool. I get it. Your characters are FBI agents
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知怎么  穿越到了月门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That somehow traveled to Moondoor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们这周只做月门\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm telling you it's straight-up Moondoor this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These aren't fake badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  而且做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, they are, and they're very good,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是年底的时候  证件号变成10位的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um, well, the I.D. number shifted to 10 digits
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后两位是字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}with two letters mixed in at the end of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这个章是上个月的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, the seal's from last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这个周末有大战  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just it's a tournament weekend, okay, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得按规矩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got to follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有规矩  就乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's no rules -- chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们愿意加入月军\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would like to join the Army of Moons,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王一直在招募侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}the queen is always on the lookout for new squires.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那请带我们去觐见女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we would like to see your queen now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王的行程在几个月前就定好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the Queen's calendar is booked up months in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们想看看她的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you wish to witness what's in store for you in her army,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王陛下正在场地中检阅新兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}her highness is overseeing new squires on the pitch as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认输  我认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yield! I yield!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去我的医疗帐篷休息一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your leave to my medical tent
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治一下你腿上的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and attend to your... severed limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灰狐狸和撒格瑞姆失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greyfox and Thargrim are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们向女神祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pray to the goddess
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有遭遇其他队伍的犯规行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have not fallen victim of foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}In their absence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,荣誉护卫队的力量就变弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the honor guard's ranks are weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要加入...\N{\fnArial\fs30}To join...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Blerg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王我需要一点私人时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Queen needs some royal "We" Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们自己聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk amongst thyselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理·布拉德伯里已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Bradbury is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一年前就死了  你害死了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died a year ago. You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫卡莉·席勒顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Carrie Heinlein.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  你现在又要害死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and guess what. Now you killed her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我隐姓埋名\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I buried myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后迪克·罗曼倒台  他的公司也垮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Dick Roman went down, his company belly-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就想  终于安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I figure, "Hey, it's all good",
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我平安无事  能找回原来的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was fine. I got my life back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你们又出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们出现了  说明这儿有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you guys are here, monsters are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我总是这么倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I have such bad luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我算什么  怪物吸铁石吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I -- some kind of monster magnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上有这种的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there such a thing as a monster magnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了  不要回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Don't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:35.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我关心的是不要再把手臂弄骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I care about is not getting my other arm broken...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至丢掉小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  我现在扔下剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm dropping my sword
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后离开这里  混蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and walking off the stage, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们在城堡里扫荡愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun storming the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理  查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie. Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灰狐狸和撒格瑞姆  也就是艾德和兰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greyfox and thargrim -- uh, Ed and Lance --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车裂后流血而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drawn and quartered and bleeding out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再描述给我听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop talking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们认为是什么东西干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了标记和都参加角色扮演以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aside from the mark and them both being larpers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么其他的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's really not much else to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是凯尔特人的魔法标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Celtic magic symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.69,0:17:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码在我最喜欢的电子游戏里是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it was in my favorite video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有用吗  我能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that help? Can I go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个开头  别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a start, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能告诉我们一些关于艾德和兰斯的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell us about Ed and Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王曾经所向无敌的军队中最优秀的两名成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of the best members of the Queen's ever-shrinking army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经所向无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ever-shrinking"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的王国最近有些不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kingdom has had a lot of bad luck lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为我  但也许与这事有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably 'cause of me, but maybe it's tied to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月前  \N{\fnArial\fs30}A month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的一个卫兵在战斗前摔伤了膝盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of my guys had both her ankles broken before battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再之前  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Before that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有三个人在家里遭遇了事故而进医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had three people have hospital-worthy accidents while at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得这当中有关联吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there's any connection there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有共同的敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have any enemies in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在现实生活中没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}In real life? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都和睦相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone gets along famously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是在游戏中  他们有很多敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the game, though, they had tons of enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红色代表月随者  就是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red reps the followers of the moon -- my peeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色代表精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green's for elves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蓝色是亡灵战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue's for warriors of yesteryear,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑色是影兽人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and black's for shadow orcs --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻底的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}total d-bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个周末将会有王国间的争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This weekend is the battle of the kingdoms
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定谁能带上永恒王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see who wears the forever crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.52,0:18:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}This weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一个王国都是我们王国的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}each faction is definitely an enemy of me and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  如果你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撤回弓箭手并让宽剑手去西边\N{\fnArial\fs30}move your archers back and your broadswordsmen to the west...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-和亡灵战士一样  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh. Like the warriors. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, good call. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.15,0:18:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那南边的城墙怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the southern wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-伙计们  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对哦  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也许其他王国的某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe someone from one of the other kingdoms
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掌握了真正的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}got ahold of real magic
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并用来削弱你的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and started using it to weaken your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但为什么不直接针对我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why not just come after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会逐步升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why the escalation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们会仔细排查所有王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we will canvass the kingdoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该赶快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想你受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want you to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理比我们更加了解月门游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie knows Moondoor a lot better than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我觉得我们完全能够搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I think we can take care of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群举着泡沫塑料剑的会计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bunch of accountants with foam swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要任何能得到的帮助  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need all the help we can get, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人面临生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的想法是  一般你也都这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point, which is usually yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:50.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该逃去一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that she should get somewhere safe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恢复平凡的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get back to a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里  我想要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I am right here, and I want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:18:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她必须留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}she has to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆说的对  有人有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Sam is right. People are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能看着这事儿发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't happen on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我已经厌倦了逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? I am tired of running.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这里的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like my life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要留下  为此而战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stay and fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.61,0:19:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯的毒理报告出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the toxicology report came back on Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有中毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但法医说他的身体上有明显的痕迹显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the medical examiner said his body showed clear signs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是被莨菪毒死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was killed by belladonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是黄片影星吗  -黄片影星吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The porn star? - The porn star?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一种毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们在体内找不到任何中毒痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, however, they couldn't find a trace of it in his system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他们在艾德的公寓里找不到一根绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like they couldn't find ropes in Ed's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理  我想借用一下你的笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I'm gonna need to borrow your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月门游戏中不能带笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no laptops in Moondoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛  规定就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? There are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但四个帐篷之外是技术支持帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a tech tent four tents down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你们俩查游戏里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you guys go canvas,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去查死亡事件和这个标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll dig into these accidents and this mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你们所到之地的所有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a full wiki on where you guys have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是首先  你要扔掉这西装\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, you're gonna have to ditch the suit
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想和女王边走边谈的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're gonna walk and talk with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(当心  通往未来的传送门)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问有没有一个在线玩家的目录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know if there's a directory of online players?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啊  在网页上有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's on the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有账号就能进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need is an account to access it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, thanks, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  邪恶法师格兰吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Gholandria the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用萨姆前女友的身份跟他发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent Sam a phantom text from his ex?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真混球  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick move, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  偶尔犯浑而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not my finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:11.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他终于和这个妞找到点儿正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he found some normalcy with this chick,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后都没了  再一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now it's gone... again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.35,0:21:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他这些投入的感情最多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, now he's more committed than ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以麻烦就大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  相信我  这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, trust me, this life --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能有任何牵挂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't afford attachments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只能让它  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to... let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.43,0:21:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是在说萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we still talking about Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是你最近也跟某人分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or did you break up with someone, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直很喜欢真人扮演么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always been into larping?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.91,0:21:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起角色扮演  我更喜欢台式机\N{\fnArial\fs30}For role-play, I prefer a tabletop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙与地下城  伽玛世界  汽车大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}D&D, Gamma world, Car wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是为什么克鲁苏发明了多面色子  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Cthulhu invented multi-sided dice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我的一个伙计喜欢真人扮演\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a buddy of mine was into larping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:21:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻他而来  为佳人而留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went for him, stayed for the chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.41,0:22:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是种逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里  我是女王  一个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, here, I'm queen, a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在真实世界  我只是一个整天入侵代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there in the real world, I'm just hacking out code
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.15,0:22:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝喝咖啡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and chugging coffee all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远都不会干掉迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would have never been able to take down Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在真实世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到有很多女士在打量你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm noticing a lot of these maidens checking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.28,0:22:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我又不能阻止她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I can't shut this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当女王真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to be queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  这只不过是游戏的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's -- it's all just part of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.23,0:22:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混合技术搭建  酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genre mash-up. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识她  那是菲利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know her. That's Phyllis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说她摔断了脚踝还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard she broke her ankles or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:22:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇  看起来她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. It looks like she got --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:22:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.12,0:23:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个是杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and that's Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说有人闯进他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said someone broke into his house,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用他自己的权杖锤打他  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}beat him with his own mace, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有闯入的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signs of a forced entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是月门里的什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do you recognize this from Moondoor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是凯尔特人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think it's Celtic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是我会查查看  -谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I'll look it up. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在各个王国穿梭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen anything like it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但从没见过这样的东西  圣上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my travels throughout the realms, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.55,0:23:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.47,0:23:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想到了什么  来我的帐篷见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you think of anything, come see me in my tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:37.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把精灵从单子上划掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scratch the elves off the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,权杖  跛子  中世界毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mace attacks, hobbling, medieval poisoning --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在对女王的人下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's targeting the queen's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不只是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not only them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  这四个人是女王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, those four are with the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两个是精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these two -- they're elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.63,0:23:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有两个是亡灵战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these two are warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.35,0:23:52.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一没有受害的人是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only group not to get hit --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影兽人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shadow orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.72,0:23:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单子上最后的种族  不可能找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last group on the list, impossible to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.78,0:23:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我知道哪里可以找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I know where we can find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.96,0:23:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我进来的路上碰到的  -太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I met him on the way in. - Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.16,0:24:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他能告诉我们这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he can tell us what the frack this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是痛苦之树\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, the tree of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你被这个标记了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if you are tagged with this mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会成为仙境魔法的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be a victim of fairy magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.21,0:24:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  仙境魔法会对人不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Fairy magic can be bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.59,0:24:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death to the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.16,0:24:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,篡位者去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death to the usurper!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.39,0:24:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男仆去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death to her manservant!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.35,0:24:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月门里没有笔记本电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's no laptops in Moondoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里也没有日内瓦公约\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no Geneva Convention, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.77,0:24:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看过这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.42,0:24:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.65,0:24:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  没  我没看过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I haven't seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.71,0:24:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这是暗影之王的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's the Shadow King's family crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远也不会再黑山找的这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never find him in the black hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.79,0:24:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.79,0:24:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游乐场背后的森林  来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The forest behind the playground. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  非常感谢  格兰吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, uh, well, thank you very much, Gholandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.93,0:24:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.59,0:24:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没有玩过混合技术搭建\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never done genre-mash-up play before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.27,0:24:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始都是新鲜的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time for everything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.74,0:25:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多都可以是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time for a lot of things
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.73,0:25:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想来我的帐篷话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to come find my tent later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.09,0:25:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.78,0:25:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王殿下  你在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My queen. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找你找遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been searching everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.67,0:25:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个呆瓜要用他渎神的利剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has this... oaf attempted to harm you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.82,0:25:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤害您吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his blasphemous metalworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波尔塔  他和我一路的  这是我的新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boltar, he's with me. This is my new...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.29,0:25:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handmaiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找认识暗影之王的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seek an audience with the shadow king.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.85,0:25:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些山不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, these hills are not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恳求您  我的女王  请回帐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beseech you, my queen, you should return to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.88,0:25:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是对的  我主\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right... your worshipfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.01,0:25:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你离开前我能说两句话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, may I have a moment before you take your leavings?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.37,0:25:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handmaiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.53,0:25:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他生疑了  我很惊慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was suspicious. I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.75,0:25:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你拿着我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look. You take my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.28,0:25:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到萨姆  我们来找暗影呆瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Sam. We'll find the shadow dorks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.81,0:25:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮忙找萨姆  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you are helping by finding Sam. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.08,0:26:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带路去找兽人吧  波尔蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the way to the orcs, Bolty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人问起你的时候你再回话  女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak when spoken to, handmaiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.93,0:26:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! Dark magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.89,0:26:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你攻击的刺痛灼烧着我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stinging of your attack burns my very soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.73,0:27:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.91,0:27:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是白去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.96,0:27:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定影兽人在那儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure the Shadow Orcs are even out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.82,0:27:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于一个女仆来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a handmaiden,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.69,0:27:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你实在问得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you certainly ask many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是非常善于隐藏自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just very good at hiding themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.61,0:27:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我突然想起来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a plan has sprung to mind
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以把暗影之王引出来的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will draw the shadow king to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.12,0:27:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该把影兽人关押起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall take the shadow orc held in stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.77,0:27:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他做战俘交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}offer him up as a prisoner exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他引出来再打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw him out and beat him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.23,0:27:39.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的风格  波尔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your style, Boltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.79,0:27:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去集合战俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall retrieve the prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去照顾女王的洗衣房和夜壶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tend to the queen's laundry and chamber pots,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后在这儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}then meet me back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.22,0:27:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装备不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.83,0:27:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  当你在玩角色扮演时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, while you were, uh, playing dress-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.25,0:27:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现那标记是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out that the mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.35,0:27:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是影兽人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belongs to the Shadow Orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.61,0:28:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  而且他们在使用精灵魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And they're using fairy magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.92,0:28:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛苦之树  太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tree of pain. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡是身上有标记的都遇袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever gets marked gets ganked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我们怎么阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, how do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.23,0:28:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找出是谁施了咒语  把他除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find whoever cast the spell, and take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除掉咒语  就不再有标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more whammy, no more marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.77,0:28:13.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有标记  就不会再有人遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more marks, no more dead bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.05,0:28:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个多嘴波尔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our, uh, pal Boltar the chatty
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.45,0:28:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找影兽人的战俘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is getting the, uh, shadow orc prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.90,0:28:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会进行一笔战俘交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do a little prisoner exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.07,0:28:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把藏匿的暗影之王引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to draw the king out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.20,0:28:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是我的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她刚才和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我让她去找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I sent her to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.82,0:28:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.90,0:28:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.42,0:28:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.26,0:28:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  她拿着我的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what -- she's got my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.05,0:28:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打打看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(无信号)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.95,0:29:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是月女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the, uh, queen... of moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.56,0:29:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.55,0:29:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服装不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great costume, B.T. Dubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.65,0:29:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.69,0:29:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真的是场不错的绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this has been a really great kidnapping,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.09,0:29:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要回去不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got to get back to not dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.34,0:29:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你谈话很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.67,0:29:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很酷  如果没这么恐怖的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is really cool, if not mostly terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.05,0:29:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.49,0:29:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把事解决掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work this out, can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.23,0:29:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你点黄金  或者我的王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you some gold, my crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.32,0:30:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再或者祭祀仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ritualistic sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.58,0:30:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是真的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I am not really a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.42,0:30:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个搞计算机的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just an I.T. Girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.85,0:30:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在一个怪物面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing in front of a monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.21,0:30:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请求不要杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking it not to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.09,0:30:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.03,0:30:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我人生最糟糕的时期结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the worst period of my life comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.74,0:30:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见我的老板被利维坦吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw my boss get eaten by a leviathan,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.10,0:30:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摔坏了胳膊  四处奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke my arm, lived life on the run,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}finally got it all back,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在一个带着颅骨面具的家伙又要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now a dude in a stag-skull mask is gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想找回以前的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want my old life back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.35,0:30:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也正是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all I want, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓  她要是有个三长两短\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, if anything's happened to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.25,0:30:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找过了所有的帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we checked all the tents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.36,0:30:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们四处询问  一定会找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk to these guys. We'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.14,0:31:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.63,0:31:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该在我面前跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should kneel before me, cur.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.88,0:31:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你干脆让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, why don't you let me --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.78,0:31:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.09,0:31:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们做交换之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, before we exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.79,0:31:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说几条公告\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few announcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.51,0:31:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天在一号场地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, there is a peewee-league soccer playoff game tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.03,0:31:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个迷你杯足球季后赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the alpha field.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.14,0:31:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想惊吓那些现代人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to freak out the mundanes,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以决定把场地改到二号场地\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we got to move the battle of kingdoms to the beta field.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.52,0:31:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.15,0:31:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要用老方法解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm gonna do this the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  不要  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, don't.  - No, I'm --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.41,0:31:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我告诉你了  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you there are... - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.27,0:31:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要真正的回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I need real answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是真枪  看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is a real gun, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:44.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我  女王在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, start talking. Where's the queen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.42,0:31:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你胸前的家族徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, your little family crest there
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.28,0:31:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是这么说的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}tells a different story, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.86,0:31:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这个  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:31:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上个月就在这个标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I got sick last month
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我胳膊上出现后我就病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after this thing just appeared on my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.70,0:31:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it looked really cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.39,0:32:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把它当做我的家族徽章了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I turned it into my family crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.57,0:32:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的皮肤医生说这不是恶性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after my dermatologist said it wasn't malignant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他不是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, he's not our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.88,0:32:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是一名受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just another vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.73,0:32:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫马斯克·希尔比  我是名律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Max Hilby. I'm an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.59,0:32:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道女王在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea where the queen is,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.19,0:32:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你现在放我走  我不会起诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you let me go right now, I won't press charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.33,0:32:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.76,0:32:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个  给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Uh, take them. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.22,0:32:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.87,0:32:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.05,0:32:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.67,0:32:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女王真的遇到危险了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the queen really in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.07,0:32:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到小溪旁有一些奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, I-I noticed something odd down by the creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.69,0:32:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一顶奇怪的帐篷  不是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this weird tent. It's not one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.46,0:32:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么一下子这么有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you being so helpful all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.43,0:32:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢上女王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I harbor an epic crush on the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.70,0:32:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们可以找到她时替我美言几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could put in a good word for me when you find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.53,0:32:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你不是她的口味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're her type.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.11,0:33:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你是说她不喜欢兽人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You mean she's not into orcs?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.38,0:33:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫吉尔达\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Gilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.94,0:33:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来自阿克莫尔的神圣树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from the hollow forest of Arkhmoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.13,0:33:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一个仙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.38,0:33:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Swoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.02,0:33:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你是怎么到这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I mean, how did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.73,0:33:23.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是被一条咒语召唤来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was summoned here by a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.25,0:33:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}By whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.09,0:33:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.27,0:33:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我是被招来服从他的命令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was brought here to do his bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的命令  绝不是什么好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bidding? That's never good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My...master,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.46,0:33:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我伤害人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}he... he has me hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.77,0:33:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他逼迫我做的  否则我绝不会伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's forcing me to. I'd never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.73,0:33:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一个仙女  善良的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fairy...the good kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.91,0:33:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  他为什么这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I get that. Why is he doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.48,0:33:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.36,0:33:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他开始时只下达一些小命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started off with smaller commands,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.15,0:33:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他现在越来越暴力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's become more violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.15,0:33:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一周他让我杀了两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had me kill two men this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.45,0:34:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  有人把这个游戏看得太认真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, someone is taking this game way too seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.13,0:34:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.84,0:34:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个  我的装备  这所有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- my outfit, all of this --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.00,0:34:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这仅仅是个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a game here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.73,0:34:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么要玩这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you play such a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.43,0:34:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实常常让人不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world -- not so much with awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.28,0:34:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩这个游戏是为了逃避现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is a way to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.55,0:34:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个森林很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lovely forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.67,0:34:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但跟我的家完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's nothing like my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.07,0:34:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.16,0:34:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么把你送回去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we get you back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.72,0:34:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己没法从咒语中解脱出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't break free from the spell, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有个英雄偷走我主人的魔法书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hero must take my master's book of magic
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:40.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毁掉它  破除咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy it, breaking the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.61,0:34:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔达  我叫查理·布拉德布利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilda, my name is Charlie Bradbury,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来拯救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am here to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.26,0:34:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不离开  波尔蒂  我们自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take off, Bolty? We got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.37,0:35:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个女仆和一个时间旅行者拯救女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handmaiden and a time traveler rescue the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.69,0:35:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不这么认为  善良的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not, kind lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.96,0:35:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这可不是游戏  波尔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this isn't a game, Boltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.51,0:35:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的朋友  这位女王  真的有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen, our friend, is in real danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.10,0:35:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.83,0:35:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会置我的女王于危险而不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not leave my queen in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.66,0:35:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.05,0:35:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没检查过那个帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't checked that tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.86,0:35:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.16,0:35:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果帐篷在抖  拜托别不敲门就跑进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the tent is rockin', don't come a-knockin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  就是他  我的主人  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's him! My master! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.35,0:35:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月门里可没有枪  先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No guns in moondoor, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.56,0:35:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔达  来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilda, if you please?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.79,0:36:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  现在你想怎样  杰里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now what, Gerry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.47,0:36:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫狂怒波尔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Boltar the Furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.34,0:36:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我原本计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan was,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.29,0:36:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摆脱所有的竞争者后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after getting rid of all of my competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天赢得比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}to win the battle tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.95,0:36:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说服女王我应该做她的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}convincing the queen that I should be her king.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.18,0:36:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果你们两个白痴跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you two idiots showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.57,0:36:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不见机行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was forced to improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.73,0:36:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将悲伤的少女从影兽人手中解救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue the damsel in distress from Orcs,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.41,0:36:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当上国王  杀掉你俩  这样也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}become king, kill you both -- that'll work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.06,0:36:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么要从弄瘸别人升级为谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did you go from hobbling to murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.85,0:36:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灰狐狸和撒格瑞姆做了荣誉护卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greyfox and Thargrim became part of the honor guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.30,0:36:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们接近了女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got close to the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.75,0:36:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们是通过破坏规矩达成目的的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they did it by breaking the rules --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真金白银贿赂其他选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}paying off other players with real money,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不用月门的货币\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than moondoor currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.11,0:36:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是在作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.29,0:36:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  那用魔法就不算作弊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and using magic isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.28,0:36:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法是月门的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic is a part of moondoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.97,0:36:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要伤害别人  这是个游戏而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you hurt people? This is just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.58,0:36:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是什么游戏  只有月门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no game! There is only moondoor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里就是为了与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to be different,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.42,0:37:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃离我的无聊人生  做个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get away from my crappy life, to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.54,0:37:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.57,0:37:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你是个现实生活中的卢瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you were a loser in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.37,0:37:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里照样是卢瑟  \N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're a loser here? Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.17,0:37:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卢瑟能够根据一本魔法书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would a loser track down a real book of spells
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.13,0:37:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强迫仙女服从他的命令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and compel a fairy to do his bidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.33,0:37:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不准  你怎么拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends. How'd you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.14,0:37:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,淘宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}eBay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.85,0:37:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.11,0:37:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波尔塔  你没必要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be like this, Boltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.92,0:37:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把魔法书交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hand over the book of spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.31,0:37:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了结这件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.89,0:37:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿最终会了结的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will all work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.68,0:37:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是得等我把你们踢出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I remove you from the playing field
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.44,0:37:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抹去她的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wipe her memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.78,0:37:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilda?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.70,0:37:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔达  那个大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilda, the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.11,0:38:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.76,0:38:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那本书  你必须毁掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book -- you must destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  杰里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.18,0:38:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才是解救悲伤少女的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who saves damsels in distress around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.44,0:38:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.24,0:38:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.75,0:38:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从咒语中解放了  你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm free of the spell. You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.77,0:38:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神圣森林永远都欠你的人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hollow forest is forever in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.28,0:38:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在必须回到那些绿山\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must return to those green hills now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.67,0:38:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要把前主人带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take my former master with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.30,0:38:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他必须因自己的罪行面对仙女裁判所\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must face a fairy tribunal for his sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.97,0:38:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.04,0:39:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能的话给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.55,0:39:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来你要去哪里  查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's next for you, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.00,0:39:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的小镇  换个新身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}New town? New identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.46,0:39:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果说这24小时教会了我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the last 24 hours have taught me anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.97,0:39:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是逃避解决不了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that escaping isn't what it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.16,0:39:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会换身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more replacement characters for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.01,0:39:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起  我要面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to face reality from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.89,0:39:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛苦的是  现实中真的有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, reality actually includes monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.54,0:39:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们接下来要去做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.51,0:39:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有什么能帮到你们的  尽管开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can ever be of help to you guys, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.59,0:39:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.60,0:39:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, uh... you're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.35,0:39:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}apart from the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.38,0:39:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你阻碍我跟个仙女上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you blocked me from banging a fairy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.41,0:39:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我即将会在战役中输掉王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm about to go lose my crown in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.81,0:39:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的军队被消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to my army being decimated?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.16,0:39:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Totally good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.91,0:39:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了  娘们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell you later, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  接下来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's, uh... what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.83,0:40:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点儿都不好玩  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause no fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.15,0:40:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你开口之前我要说  我明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, before you say anything, I-I-I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.41,0:40:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为没有什么乐趣能够\N{\fnArial\fs30}No amount of fun is gonna help you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.16,0:40:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥补你所放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}get over what you gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.13,0:40:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你嘛  你需要时间  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just, uh... you need time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.54,0:40:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.13,0:40:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找乐子帮不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having fun won't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.04,0:40:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮的是我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.94,0:40:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.15,0:40:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多年后  当你在床上垂死挣扎时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dying in your beds many years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.83,0:40:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意拿从今天开始到死之前那些日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you be willing to trade all the days,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.96,0:40:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来换一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}from this day to that, for one chance --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.46,0:41:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话不是从那里...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the speech from --
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.43,0:41:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只读过那一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only one he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.26,0:41:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到这里的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one chance to come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.81,0:41:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们的敌人  他们或许能够消灭肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell our enemies that they may take our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.50,0:41:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们永远都夺取不了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they will never take...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.99,0:41:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.59,0:41:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.57,0:41:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.50,0:41:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}...our freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.57,0:41:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本集谨献给
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.81,0:41:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为王者之战中的月女王牺牲自我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.89,0:41:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奋力搏斗  赢得战争的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.20,0:41:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人  女人  精灵  半神  魔法师
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祭司  和端夜壶的仆人们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.68,0:41:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勇敢奔向下一个世界  陨落的战士们
